# ==============================================================================
# Database: IEEE OUI Hardware Vendor & Device Type Mapping
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   OUI (XX:XX:XX) | Vendor Name | Default OS | Device Type | Score (1-99)
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. OUI must be in uppercase 6-character hex format with colons (XX:XX:XX).
#   2. Matched via exact prefix lookup (^OUI|). Order does not affect matching.
#   3. Randomized MAC addresses automatically bypass OUI evaluation.
#
# Example:
#   1C:83:41|Hefei Bitland|Linux|server|50
#   E8:FB:1C|AzureWave Technology|Windows|pc|60
# ==============================================================================

